		'correct_option' => 'd',
		'explanation'    => 'A. Incorrect. Diagnosis and treatment planning ordinarily belong to the general clinical record and are not psychotherapy notes.
B. Incorrect. Session dates and billing information are ordinary record information and do not fall within the special psychotherapy-note definition.
C. Incorrect. Progress notes documenting treatment, interventions, symptoms, and clinical progress are part of the official record. They do not become psychotherapy notes merely because they concern therapy.
