D. Incorrect. A value difference alone does not establish incompetence or require referral. The therapist should first assess whether the difference can be managed professionally.
CTA EXAM STRATEGY: When the therapist reacts strongly to a client’s cultural or family preference, ask:Is the therapist interpreting the client through the therapist’s own values?',
