	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist holds a valid license, has 15 years of general experience, and feels confident. The therapist has never treated the client’s specialized high-risk condition, has read only one brief article about the proposed intervention, notices strong personal reactions to the client, and plans to proceed without further evaluation. Which response best reflects the therapist’s responsibilities?',
