D. Incorrect. Abruptly withdrawing communication without explanation may confuse or distress the client. Unless immediate safety requires otherwise, the therapist should address the pattern directly and establish clearer expectations.
CTA EXAM STRATEGY: Identify the controlling rule, timing, and least disruptive response that adequately protects the client.',
